// Warehouse variation for CE Restored's Smugglers' Cove adaptation.
{1}{If a crate has a red mark, don't touch it. If it has two red marks, don't even look at it.}{If a crate has a red mark, don't touch it. If it has two red marks, don't even look at it.}{}{}{}{}
{2}{What do the marks mean?}{}{5}{}{10}{}
{3}{Who buys goods around here?}{}{5}{}{20}{}
{4}{I didn't see anything.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{5}{Why red marks?}{}{-4}{}{10}{}
{6}{Who buy things?}{}{-4}{}{20}{}
{7}{Me see nothing.}{}{-4}{}{0}{}
{10}{One means the owner is dangerous. Two means the cargo is worse. That's all you need to know.}{One means the owner is dangerous. Two means the cargo is worse. That's all you need to know.}{}{}{}{}
{11}{Who buys goods around here?}{}{5}{}{20}{}
{12}{Message received.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{13}{Me understand.}{}{-4}{}{0}{}
{20}{Marek. His stall is near the entrance. He buys almost anything, which is why nobody asks where his stock came from.}{Marek. His stall is near the entrance. He buys almost anything, which is why nobody asks where his stock came from.}{}{}{}{}
{21}{I'll speak to him.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{22}{Me find Marek.}{}{-4}{}{0}{}
